06)----------Inner Join: ci.person_id = n.id
07)------------Projection: ci.person_id, ci.movie_id, mk.movie_id, k.keyword
08)--------------Inner Join: mk.keyword_id = k.id
09)----------------Inner Join: ci.movie_id = mk.movie_id
