16)--------------------TableScan: keyword projection=[id, keyword], partial_filters=[keyword.keyword IN ([Utf8View("superhero"), Utf8View("sequel"), Utf8View("second-part"), Utf8View("marvel-comics"), Utf8View("based-on-comic"), Utf8View("tv-special"), Utf8View("fight"), Utf8View("violence")])]
17)------------SubqueryAlias: n
18)--------------TableScan: name projection=[id, name]
